[{:db/id "q-335260/field-1/fbebdfe3640ad99b5d0a113ca53969783d746e1ef4c88cdd34ea22c0124e0a7b" :answer/id #uuid "ef003f15-1358-5eb9-84f5-758637d1473c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\cos(5t)+\\sin(5t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335260/field-1/bdffb40e4bf26b62ac92e466d4f27890b68d3048d539c75ac471b30d94be5ff3" :answer/id #uuid "26bf521e-2e91-5208-9ac2-211ba3f34c3e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\cos(5t)+\\sin(5t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335260/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "49a6e944-8bd8-5c24-bd49-e7c952c9fd6c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-335260/field-1/fbebdfe3640ad99b5d0a113ca53969783d746e1ef4c88cdd34ea22c0124e0a7b" :answer-field/choices ["q-335260/field-1/fbebdfe3640ad99b5d0a113ca53969783d746e1ef4c88cdd34ea22c0124e0a7b" "q-335260/field-1/bdffb40e4bf26b62ac92e466d4f27890b68d3048d539c75ac471b30d94be5ff3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335260/field-2/793d661e8d511a11542e49506f7a99f3292c6c8d97e3274e67f79bd832384081" :answer/id #uuid "b8f1c554-6115-5329-b181-329f633fe465" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sin(5t)+\\cos(5t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335260/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "e44a5aaa-4023-5526-9086-ebe65b15de5b" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-335260/field-2/793d661e8d511a11542e49506f7a99f3292c6c8d97e3274e67f79bd832384081" :answer-field/choices ["q-335260/field-2/793d661e8d511a11542e49506f7a99f3292c6c8d97e3274e67f79bd832384081"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335260" :question/id #uuid "29054d88-29fd-5238-a340-8f5e32c893bf" :question/math-academy-id "q-335260" :question/problem "$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=5y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=-5x(t),\\end{aligned}\\,[\\begin{aligned}x(0) \\\\ y(0)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nFind the solution to the initial value problem above.\n\n*Hint: ${e}^{At}=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t) & \\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)\\end{aligned}],$ where $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 5 \\\\ -5 & 0\\end{aligned}].$*\n\n| $[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}]=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 5 \\\\ -5 & 0\\end{aligned}]x(t),\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}].$ So, the matrix of the system is $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 5 \\\\ -5 & 0\\end{aligned}].$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the solution of the initial value problem can be written as\n\n$$\nx(t)={Φ}_{0}(t)\\,x(0),\n$$\n\nwhere ${Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}$ is the standard fundamental matrix of the system, and $x(0)$ is the initial condition vector.\n\nNow, using the given information, the standard fundamental matrix ${Φ}_{0}(t)$ of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t) & \\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{At}\\,x(0) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t) & \\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t)-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)\\, \\\\ \\,3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5t)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)\\,\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-335260/field-1" "q-335260/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d611c75-818f-508f-a7a4-49edb32baa41"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-335260"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-335265/selection/754ee453ba41285f9eb3b273dfa4e6d4cabc199bf11e3db4906983dbca2d7286" :answer/id #uuid "83fbfd05-8982-5353-8708-9cfe8e9c32ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335265/selection/5359b2d8d84038ce69551aa197d66f15d569b5247ccfa8ce888f223ea0b0c713" :answer/id #uuid "7e760635-3e99-5199-94da-ca122920eed6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335265/selection/b0763eb9e1b40d4ff353416f5ad04fc56c467b4ee6f250f275a2a6d3676e210d" :answer/id #uuid "474eff3c-6a82-5cf4-85a8-5e69bafa1119" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-7\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335265/selection/5590cadba8b55af041a22ab410de512ca08a977e764a94124420e934162aa52e" :answer/id #uuid "1c11745f-8eb5-5026-8f56-6684ba4f1b67" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335265/selection/7d71d08808aa5ecd117151cb35cdf3a5af2a7c653aef19ad1f1a7c582b6823bb" :answer/id #uuid "6c968feb-b575-5f82-9743-0acbbb35a1d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ -7\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335265/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7f0c10ec-56dc-5b75-8ddf-715ba10fc5e6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-335265/selection/5359b2d8d84038ce69551aa197d66f15d569b5247ccfa8ce888f223ea0b0c713" :answer-field/choices ["q-335265/selection/754ee453ba41285f9eb3b273dfa4e6d4cabc199bf11e3db4906983dbca2d7286" "q-335265/selection/5359b2d8d84038ce69551aa197d66f15d569b5247ccfa8ce888f223ea0b0c713" "q-335265/selection/b0763eb9e1b40d4ff353416f5ad04fc56c467b4ee6f250f275a2a6d3676e210d" "q-335265/selection/5590cadba8b55af041a22ab410de512ca08a977e764a94124420e934162aa52e" "q-335265/selection/7d71d08808aa5ecd117151cb35cdf3a5af2a7c653aef19ad1f1a7c582b6823bb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335265" :question/id #uuid "1a832f4b-3d78-50eb-96fa-49288eaea4c3" :question/math-academy-id "q-335265" :question/problem "$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=7y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=7x(t),\\end{aligned}\\,[\\begin{aligned}x(0) \\\\ y(0)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nFind the solution to the initial value problem above.\n\n*Hint: ${e}^{At}=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}],$ where $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 7 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{aligned}].$*" :question/worked-solution "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 7 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{aligned}]x(t),\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}].$ So, the matrix of the system is $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 7 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{aligned}].$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the solution of the initial value problem can be written as\n\n$$\nx(t)={Φ}_{0}(t)\\,x(0),\n$$\n\nwhere ${Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}$ is the standard fundamental matrix of the system, and $x(0)$ is the initial condition vector.\n\nNow, using the given information, the standard fundamental matrix ${Φ}_{0}(t)$ of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{At}\\,x(0) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-335265/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d611c75-818f-508f-a7a4-49edb32baa41"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-335265"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-335437/field-1/57bfe0a47abdafc36c7e64135d0ee6d11c1b7170c99ecbd4e71541a66c145805" :answer/id #uuid "08c863fe-870d-5313-9392-c320183e66ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\sin(8t+8)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335437/field-1/6cd60221df931fcdeda46f86d5c13e4c6004eb47460a97b28039143fb5435a5e" :answer/id #uuid "700ff51d-7a70-583e-8a1c-4a17c04206bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\sin(8t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335437/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "96b6d1d5-6f90-5bc1-b84d-f468e1c345ed" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-335437/field-1/57bfe0a47abdafc36c7e64135d0ee6d11c1b7170c99ecbd4e71541a66c145805" :answer-field/choices ["q-335437/field-1/57bfe0a47abdafc36c7e64135d0ee6d11c1b7170c99ecbd4e71541a66c145805" "q-335437/field-1/6cd60221df931fcdeda46f86d5c13e4c6004eb47460a97b28039143fb5435a5e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335437/field-2/b4403ce77c6ccba004ccbbd873fe2b30c2286ac5c50def99ea21396a1154c099" :answer/id #uuid "55cf4ee5-9920-5791-abd8-fb750fbfb11e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\cos(8t+8)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335437/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "d6edef63-0ad7-5ad1-8687-3176ef8dcf4a" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-335437/field-2/b4403ce77c6ccba004ccbbd873fe2b30c2286ac5c50def99ea21396a1154c099" :answer-field/choices ["q-335437/field-2/b4403ce77c6ccba004ccbbd873fe2b30c2286ac5c50def99ea21396a1154c099"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335437" :question/id #uuid "8e85d2c3-146c-56f3-8bc8-f5056ea2c36c" :question/math-academy-id "q-335437" :question/problem "$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=8y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=-8x(t),\\end{aligned}\\,[\\begin{aligned}x(-1) \\\\ y(-1)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nFind the solution to the initial value problem above.\n\n*Hint: ${e}^{At}=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(8t) & \\operatorname{sin}⁡(8t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(8t) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(8t)\\end{aligned}],$ where $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 \\\\ -8 & 0\\end{aligned}].$*\n\n| $[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}]=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 \\\\ -8 & 0\\end{aligned}]x(t),\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}].$ So, the matrix of the system is $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 \\\\ -8 & 0\\end{aligned}].$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the general solution of the system can be written as\n\n$$\nx(t)=Φ(t)\\,c,\n$$\n\nwhere $Φ(t)$ is a fundamental matrix of the system, and $c$ is a constant vector.\n\nSo, we can write our general solution as\n\n$$\nx(t)={Φ}_{0}(t)c={e}^{At}\\,c,\n$$\n\nwhere ${Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}$ is the standard fundamental matrix of the system. Substituting $t={t}_{0},$ we have\n\n$$\nx({t}_{0})={e}^{A{t}_{0}}\\,c,\n$$\n\nand since ${e}^{At}$ is invertible for all $t,$ we have\n\n$$\nc={e}^{-A{t}_{0}}\\,x({t}_{0}).\n$$\n\nPlugging the above back into our expression for $x(t),$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{At}\\,{e}^{-A{t}_{0}}\\,x({t}_{0}) \\\\  & ={e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}\\,x({t}_{0}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{A(t+1)}\\,x(-1) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(8(t+1)) & \\operatorname{sin}⁡(8(t+1)) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡(8(t+1)) & \\operatorname{cos}⁡(8(t+1))\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(8(t+1))\\, \\\\ \\,5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(8(t+1))\\,\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-335437/field-1" "q-335437/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "37e58bb6-6d90-5171-bba2-6ffa5a0c91d9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-335437"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-335449/selection/77bfbcfe175976f83d87016bfad54f20e1033b0e1e2e86c4010d0a7995b0b154" :answer/id #uuid "e7a8192b-8b09-55c4-b19c-7fba816ab0fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(5(t-2)) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(5(t-2))\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335449/selection/15bbce77092da4650929d14c7be3317cce4c1b3399b2785157b47c0a74f9ff5b" :answer/id #uuid "d3bf7fd4-0ade-513a-86b6-dc0bb7dedbbe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(5(t-2)) \\\\ -\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(5(t-2))\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335449/selection/9293266d525f2132ddf1d2a300d28eabd8dd7bf972b76b69a2aeac8ed89638c7" :answer/id #uuid "c1483b33-6150-5020-803a-0971248aaae4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(5(t-2)) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(5(t-2))\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335449/selection/af3d6fe6e2f5411b8c930502af05ff183b20b0986fb2ec6a3d49eb2e4f811b0b" :answer/id #uuid "56c8bc58-857b-51be-92ed-ea74101846f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(5(t-2)) \\\\ \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(5(t-2))\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335449/selection/445d7f975113d3a65fc85bb2e75d1f2f669aa6d257cf66e4169ce9b745aadac1" :answer/id #uuid "7500048a-aa55-5b56-9fa2-8d92dae7d8d9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(5(t-2)) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(5(t-2))\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335449/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2b966142-a05a-5f61-b7ea-0dca1ce7709e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-335449/selection/77bfbcfe175976f83d87016bfad54f20e1033b0e1e2e86c4010d0a7995b0b154" :answer-field/choices ["q-335449/selection/77bfbcfe175976f83d87016bfad54f20e1033b0e1e2e86c4010d0a7995b0b154" "q-335449/selection/15bbce77092da4650929d14c7be3317cce4c1b3399b2785157b47c0a74f9ff5b" "q-335449/selection/9293266d525f2132ddf1d2a300d28eabd8dd7bf972b76b69a2aeac8ed89638c7" "q-335449/selection/af3d6fe6e2f5411b8c930502af05ff183b20b0986fb2ec6a3d49eb2e4f811b0b" "q-335449/selection/445d7f975113d3a65fc85bb2e75d1f2f669aa6d257cf66e4169ce9b745aadac1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335449" :question/id #uuid "17140ce0-7f0a-5578-9bb0-2e4e6a2676d6" :question/math-academy-id "q-335449" :question/problem "$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=5y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=5x(t),\\end{aligned}\\,[\\begin{aligned}x(2) \\\\ y(2)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nFind the solution to the initial value problem above.\n\n*Hint: ${e}^{At}=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(5t) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(5t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(5t) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(5t)\\end{aligned}],$ where $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}].$*" :question/worked-solution "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}]x(t),\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}].$ So, the matrix of the system is $A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}].$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the general solution of the system can be written as\n\n$$\nx(t)=Φ(t)\\,c,\n$$\n\nwhere $Φ(t)$ is a fundamental matrix of the system, and $c$ is a constant vector.\n\nSo, we can write our general solution as\n\n$$\nx(t)={Φ}_{0}(t)c={e}^{At}\\,c,\n$$\n\nwhere ${Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}$ is the standard fundamental matrix of the system. Substituting $t={t}_{0},$ we have\n\n$$\nx({t}_{0})={e}^{A{t}_{0}}\\,c,\n$$\n\nand since ${e}^{At}$ is invertible for all $t,$ we have\n\n$$\nc={e}^{-A{t}_{0}}\\,x({t}_{0}).\n$$\n\nPlugging the above back into our expression for $x(t),$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{At}\\,{e}^{-A{t}_{0}}\\,x({t}_{0}) \\\\  & ={e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}\\,x({t}_{0}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{A(t-2)}\\,x(2) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(5(t-2)) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(5(t-2)) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(5(t-2)) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(5(t-2))\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(5(t-2)) \\\\ -\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(5(t-2))\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-335449/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "37e58bb6-6d90-5171-bba2-6ffa5a0c91d9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-335449"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-336481/field-1/bf04112ecad0043ece051a3c2a400acbf5189939a3aa2120b6b8dac43bdf2e7e" :answer/id #uuid "382ce1b5-4701-5ccf-bf5e-54da6094ea3b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "definition of a solution curve" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-336481/field-1/d12e9d9e3b596a45b7e8329d85e8c6f996f5bb29627e02778bf163d0a7c86d0b" :answer/id #uuid "e8559e23-609a-5003-be7e-a5815309fc08" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "properties of the determinant" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-336481/field-1/ed638285b2b39b62ade902fa60b790fb68a87a